<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Portal | The Trendsetter Agency</title>
<meta name="description" content="Secure portal for affiliate and partnership sign up, client login, team login, demo access, and platform login." />
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.thetrendsetteragency.com/portal/" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/trendsetter-design.css" />

<style>
.portal-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:52px 18px 80px}
.portal-kicker{text-align:center;letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fb7ff;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
.portal-title{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(46px,7vw,82px);line-height:.95;margin:0;color:#f8fbff}
.portal-subtitle{text-align:center;color:#b9c7df;font-size:22px;margin:22px auto 46px;max-width:760px}
.portal-main-card{border:1px solid rgba(120,150,255,.75);border-radius:30px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%,rgba(129,93,255,.22),transparent 38%),linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(18,25,44,.96),rgba(4,13,28,.96));box-shadow:0 0 42px rgba(80,120,255,.22);padding:54px 42px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px}
.portal-icon{font-size:58px;margin-bottom:18px}
.portal-main-card h2{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,56px);margin:0 0 18px;color:#fff}
.portal-main-card p{font-size:22px;color:#c5d1e8;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 32px;line-height:1.55}
.portal-primary-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;width:min(760px,100%);padding:24px 30px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#865cff,#10d7ee);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);box-shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(21,181,238,.25)}
.portal-list{display:grid;gap:16px}
.portal-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr auto;gap:22px;align-items:center;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);border-radius:22px;background:rgba(15,23,42,.78);padding:22px}
.portal-row-icon{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(59,130,246,.12);font-size:28px}
.portal-row h3{margin:0 0 6px;color:#fff;font-size:24px}
.portal-row p{margin:0;color:#b9c7df;font-size:17px}
.portal-small-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.28);border-radius:14px;padding:13px 18px;min-width:158px;color:#eff6ff;text-decoration:none;background:rgba(30,41,59,.85);font-weight:800}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .portal-main-card{padding:34px 20px}
  .portal-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
  .portal-small-btn{width:100%}
}

/* OWNER_POM_ACCESS — private owner entry, intentionally subtle */
.owner-pom-access{
  position:fixed;
  top:14px;
  right:16px;
  width:34px;
  height:34px;
  border-radius:999px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-size:20px;
  line-height:1;
  opacity:.32;
  z-index:9999;
  background:rgba(15,23,42,.18);
  border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.16);
  box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}
.owner-pom-access:hover{
  opacity:.82;
  transform:translateY(-1px);
}

.portal-disabled-btn{
  cursor:not-allowed;
  opacity:.58;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.portal-card-actions{
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  justify-content:flex-end;
}
.owner-pom-access{
  opacity:.58;
  background:rgba(255,244,214,.16);
}
.owner-pom-access:hover{
  opacity:1;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<a
  class="owner-pom-access"
  href="https://controltower-production.up.railway.app/admin"
  aria-label="Private owner access"
  title="Private owner access"
  rel="noopener"
>🐕</a>
<div class="wrap">

<nav class="nav">
  <a class="brand" href="/">The Trendsetter Agency</a>
  <div class="links">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <a href="/apps/health-logic/">Health Logic</a>
    <a href="/portal/">Portal</a>
    <a href="/support.html">Support</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="portal-shell">
  <div class="portal-kicker">Access</div>
  <h1 class="portal-title">Welcome</h1>
  <p class="portal-subtitle">Choose affiliate access, team access, or demo access. Owner access is private.</p>

    <section class="portal-main-card">
    <div class="portal-icon">✨</div>
    <h2>Access Portal</h2>
    <p>Use the cards below for affiliate access, team access, demo access, and approved dashboard entry.</p>
  </section>

      <section class="portal-list">
    <div class="portal-row">
      <div class="portal-row-icon">🤝</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Affiliate Login</h3>
        <p>Sign in to view referral links, QR codes, orders, commissions, and payout status.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="portal-small-btn" href="https://controltower-production.up.railway.app/affiliate/login">Login →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="portal-row">
      <div class="portal-row-icon">🧾</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Affiliate Sign Up</h3>
        <p>Create an affiliate or partner account to receive your referral link and QR code.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="portal-small-btn" href="https://controltower-production.up.railway.app/affiliate/signup">Sign Up →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="portal-row">
      <div class="portal-row-icon">👥</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Team Login</h3>
        <p>Team access is owner-approved and will be connected after the Control Tower audit.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="portal-small-btn portal-disabled-btn">Pending →</span>
    </div>

    <div class="portal-row">
      <div class="portal-row-icon">🧪</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Demo Access</h3>
        <p>Demo access is parked while affiliate and owner login are verified first.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="portal-small-btn portal-disabled-btn">Pending →</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <p>© 2026 The Trendsetter Agency LLC · <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms.html">Terms</a> · <a href="/security.html">Security</a> · <a href="/data-deletion.html">Data Deletion</a> · <a href="/portal/">Portal</a> · <a href="/support.html">Support</a></p>
</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>




